00:04:17,142 --> 00:04:23,142
Christmas with a View is a tv movie, romance,
family film directed by Justin G. Dyck.

2
00:08:34,285 --> 00:08:40,285
This Christmas, Thunder Mountain Ski Resort is abuzz when
celebrity chef Shane Roarke is named the new head chef.

3
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
Clara Garrison isn't as excited and is instead focused on getting resettled
after her failed attempt at opening a restaurant in the city.

4
00:17:08,571 --> 00:17:14,571
With their paths constantly crossing, will their shared passion for
cooking bring them together or will secrets keep them apart?

5
00:21:25,714 --> 00:21:31,714
Clara Garrison, played by Kaitlyn Leeb.

6
00:25:42,857 --> 00:25:48,857
Shane, played by Scott Cavalheiro.

