00:47:08,571 --> 00:47:14,571
The Christmas Chronicles is a 2018 American Christmas comedy film
directed by Clay Kaytis from a screenplay by Matt Lieberman.

12
00:51:25,714 --> 00:51:31,714
The film stars Kurt Russell, Judah Lewis, Darby Camp, Lamorne
Morris, Kimberly Williams-Paisley, and Oliver Hudson.

13
00:55:42,857 --> 00:55:48,857
It is the first installment in The Christmas Chronicles film series.

14
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The film was produced by 1492 Pictures and Wonder Worldwide and
was released on November 22, 2018, on Netflix.

15
01:04:17,142 --> 01:04:23,142
The plot follows two children, Kate and Teddy, who notice Santa Claus in their home and jump into his sleigh with
his reindeer; however, they accidentally cause the sleigh to crash, and the presents are lost.

16
01:08:34,285 --> 01:08:40,285
As Christmas morning approaches, it is up to the children and Santa to
save Christmas by correctly delivering all of the presents.

17
01:12:51,428 --> 01:12:57,428
The Christmas Chronicles received mixed reviews from critics.

18
01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
A sequel, titled The Christmas Chronicles 2, was released on November
25, 2020, with much of the original cast returning.

19
01:21:25,714 --> 01:21:31,714
The film explores themes of celebrity, ski resort, christmas.

20
01:25:42,857 --> 01:25:48,857
The tone is emotional.
